	"nodes":[
		{"id":"29d27e334fd57cd6","x":-125,"y":-30,"width":825,"height":270,"type":"text","text":"Created by a man named Krantho Volstar in the year 1800 P.D the first city in the Dynasty is known as Volstar and many more began to grow over the next 200 years until the current aera. \n\nCreated by Krantho a Elven man Volstar doesn’t need much talking about it rose to become what it is today but the family does.\n\nThe Volstarian family of today are direct descendants to Xandria Volstar but even the current living one Caesar is unaware and there is no found record of Xandria. The family does not have any Dunamantic power and actually worship Pelor The Dawn Father. During this Aera Krantho had two children with a Goliath woman late in his life named Caesar and  Achilles the princes of Volstar."}
